@UserService_HostAddress = https://localhost:7000

### Test service
GET {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/test

### Register a new user
POST {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssword123",
  "displayName": "Test User"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Try registering same user again (should fail)
POST {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssword123",
  "displayName": "Test User"
}

### Login with valid credentials
POST {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssword123"
}

### Login with invalid credentials
POST {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Test protected endpoint (requires valid JWT)
GET {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Test without token (should fail)
GET {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me